<view class="page"><view class="step">目标设置 · {{step}} / 2</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card" bindtap="load">{{error}}</view><view wx:elif="{{loading}}" class="card">正在加载已有目标…</view><block wx:else>
 <block wx:if="{{step === 1}}"><view class="title">你想怎样管理状态？</view><view class="subtitle">选择方向，下一步填写自己的每日目标。</view><view wx:for="{{choices}}" wx:key="key" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="choose" class="choice {{form.nutritionGoal === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{form.nutritionGoal === item.key ? '已选' : '选择'}}</text></view><button class="btn-primary" bindtap="next">下一步</button></block>
 <block wx:else><view class="title">设置每日目标</view><view class="subtitle">沿用已有热量目标，可按自己的计划修改。选择目标方向不会自动增减热量。</view>
 <view class="card"><view class="field"><text>热量目标 · kcal</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.dailyCalorieTarget}}" data-field="dailyCalorieTarget" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写每日热量" disabled="{{saving}}"/></view><view class="field"><text>饮水目标 · ml</text><input type="number" value="{{form.dailyWaterTarget}}" data-field="dailyWaterTarget" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写每日饮水量" disabled="{{saving}}"/></view></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="card-title">营养素目标（可选）</view><view class="field"><text>蛋白质 · g</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.proteinTarget}}" data-field="proteinTarget" bindinput="input" placeholder="未设置" disabled="{{saving}}"/></view><view class="field"><text>碳水化合物 · g</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.carbTarget}}" data-field="carbTarget" bindinput="input" placeholder="未设置" disabled="{{saving}}"/></view><view class="field"><text>脂肪 · g</text><input type="digit" value="{{form.fatTarget}}" data-field="fatTarget" bindinput="input" placeholder="未设置" disabled="{{saving}}"/></view><view class="subtitle">本期保存营养素目标供参考，食物库尚不统计实际营养素摄入。留空表示不设置该项。</view></view>
 <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="save" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存目标</button><button class="back" bindtap="back" disabled="{{saving}}">上一步</button></block></block></view>
